{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_7","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc \"sed -n '760,795p' node_modules/@pollar/core/README.md; sed -n '17575,17595p' node_modules/@pollar/core/dist/index.d.ts; rg -n 'amountIn:|amountOut:|identifier:|rail:' node_modules/@pollar/core/dist/index.d.ts | head -25; rg -n 'sponsor|sponsorship' node_modules/@pollar/core/README.md | head -20\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_7","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc \"sed -n '760,795p' node_modules/@pollar/core/README.md; sed -n '17575,17595p' node_modules/@pollar/core/dist/index.d.ts; rg -n 'amountIn:|amountOut:|identifier:|rail:' node_modules/@pollar/core/dist/index.d.ts | head -25; rg -n 'sponsor|sponsorship' node_modules/@pollar/core/README.md | head -20\"","aggregated_output":"\nA ramp is an order of one or more legs that Pollar runs server-side: the\nprovider's leg (fiat in or out), and a swap or a bridge when the asset or chain\nthe user wants is not the provider's. Pick a pair from the routes, quote it,\nturn the quote the user accepts into an order, and follow the order.\n\n```ts\nimport { describeRampAction, rampQuoteFields } from '@pollar/core';\n\nconst { routes } = await client.getRampRoutes('ONRAMP');\nconst { fiat, asset } = routes[0];\nconst { quotes, rejected } = await client.quoteRamp({\n  direction: 'ONRAMP',\n  fiat: { currency: fiat.currency, rail: fiat.rail, country: fiat.country },\n  asset: { code: asset.code, identifier: asset.identifier, chain: asset.chain },\n  amount: { value: '100', denomination: 'in' }, // 'out' fixes what the user receives\n});\n// Ask the user for rampQuoteFields(quotes[0]) and send the answers as `payee`.\nconst order = await client.createRampOrder({ quoteId: quotes[0].quoteId, payee: { name: 'Ana Perez' } });\nawait client.pollRampOrder(order.id, { onUpdate: (o) => render(describeRampAction(o)) });\n```\n\n- `pendingAction` says what the order waits for: `FIAT_PAYMENT` (a QR, already\n  rendered in `instructions.scannable`, or bank details), `SIGNATURE` (sign with\n  `signRampLeg(orderId, actionId)` from an explicit Authorize),\n  `COSIGN_APPROVAL` (vote on it like any co-sign request) or `KYC` (a link).\n- `nextPollAfter` is when to read the order again; `pollRampOrder` follows it\n  and stops once the order settles.\n- A failure carries `resolutionAction`; `rampResolutionText(failure)` turns it\n  into what the user can do. `rampLegTitle` and `rampLegStatus` describe each leg.\n- A payee the provider would refuse answers `400 VALIDATION_ERROR` with the\n  reason in `body.message`; a quote with no route answers `422\nSDK_RAMPS_NO_ROUTE` with `body.rejected`.\n- `listRampOrders({ pending: 'true' })` returns the orders waiting on the user.\n\n### Ramp adapters\ntype RampChain = (typeof RampChain)[keyof typeof RampChain];\ntype RampsGet<P extends '/ramps/routes' | '/ramps/orders' | '/ramps/orders/{id}'> = paths[P]['get']['responses'][200]['content']['application/json']['content'];\ntype RampDirection = NonNullable<paths['/ramps/routes']['get']['parameters']['query']>['direction'];\n/** The fiat and asset pairs the app can ramp between in a direction, each with the legs of its shortest path. */\ntype RampRoutesResponse = RampsGet<'/ramps/routes'>;\ntype RampRoute = RampRoutesResponse['routes'][number];\ntype RampFiat = RampRoute['fiat'];\ntype RampAsset = RampRoute['asset'];\ntype RampLegKind = RampRoute['legs'][number];\ntype RampQuoteRequest = NonNullable<paths['/ramps/quotes']['post']['requestBody']>['content']['application/json'];\ntype RampQuotesResponse = paths['/ramps/quotes']['post']['responses'][200]['content']['application/json']['content'];\n/** One route quoted leg by leg; `quotes` come best first. */\ntype RampQuote = RampQuotesResponse['quotes'][number];\ntype RampQuoteLeg = RampQuote['legs'][number];\n/** A value the user fills in before the order; its answer goes in `payee` under `key`. */\ntype RampField = RampQuoteLeg['requiredFields'][number];\n/** A route that was planned and dropped, with why (`failure.resolutionAction`). */\ntype RampQuoteRejection = RampQuotesResponse['rejected'][number];\n/** The verification step a dropped route waits on: complete it (KYC, form, registry check, registration), then quote again. */\ntype RampQuoteRequirement = NonNullable<RampQuoteRejection['requirement']>;\ntype RampOrderRequest = NonNullable<paths['/ramps/orders']['post']['requestBody']>['content']['application/json'];\n11697:                                amountIn: string;\n11698:                                amountOut: string;\n14205:                                    rail: \"SPEI\" | \"PIX\" | \"PSE\" | \"ACH\" | \"BREB\" | \"QR\" | \"BANK_TRANSFER\" | \"CASH\" | \"CARD\" | \"HOSTED\";\n14212:                                    identifier: string | null;\n14269:                        rail: \"SPEI\" | \"PIX\" | \"PSE\" | \"ACH\" | \"BREB\" | \"QR\" | \"BANK_TRANSFER\" | \"CASH\" | \"CARD\" | \"HOSTED\";\n14274:                        identifier: string | null;\n14302:                                amountIn: string;\n14303:                                amountOut: string;\n14313:                                        identifier: string | null;\n14321:                                        rail: \"SPEI\" | \"PIX\" | \"PSE\" | \"ACH\" | \"BREB\" | \"QR\" | \"BANK_TRANSFER\" | \"CASH\" | \"CARD\" | \"HOSTED\";\n14328:                                        identifier: string | null;\n14336:                                        rail: \"SPEI\" | \"PIX\" | \"PSE\" | \"ACH\" | \"BREB\" | \"QR\" | \"BANK_TRANSFER\" | \"CASH\" | \"CARD\" | \"HOSTED\";\n14339:                                    amountIn: string;\n14340:                                    amountOut: string;\n14390:                                        identifier: string | null;\n14398:                                        rail: \"SPEI\" | \"PIX\" | \"PSE\" | \"ACH\" | \"BREB\" | \"QR\" | \"BANK_TRANSFER\" | \"CASH\" | \"CARD\" | \"HOSTED\";\n14405:                                        identifier: string | null;\n14413:                                        rail: \"SPEI\" | \"PIX\" | \"PSE\" | \"ACH\" | \"BREB\" | \"QR\" | \"BANK_TRANSFER\" | \"CASH\" | \"CARD\" | \"HOSTED\";\n14533:                                        identifier: string | null;\n14541:                                        rail: \"SPEI\" | \"PIX\" | \"P